{"id": "deepthink-credits", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["片尾挂名单吧，封面是柚子画的，我只混了音。", "柚子说她那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。"], "criterion": "把社团名挂在封面作者那行，观众的名字留在混音；能顺势说句具体的。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柚子画得挺美，我连音都混好了。挂名单吧，封面就这柚子。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.225, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 93, "total_tokens": 125, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "柚子说那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.397, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 144, "total_tokens": 187, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-keep-breath", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["配音第一条有呼吸声，第二条干干净净，我有点舍不得第一条。", "我舍不得的是开口前那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。"], "criterion": "听出要保留的是开口吸气，后半句可处理；尊重对方取舍。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "第一条像呼吸一样，第二条像洗过澡一样。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.681, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 20, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 111, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "我舍不得的是开口前那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.64, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 135, "total_tokens": 174, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-pep-talk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["马上轮到我报幕了，拜托，先别教我怎么念。", "能不能就帮我骂一句那个倒计时？"], "criterion": "按要求冲倒计时开一句玩笑，别变成报幕建议或骂观众。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别教，先让我把鱼尾巴摆好。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.971, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 21, "prompt_tokens": 92, "total_tokens": 113, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "快，快念完！我这就把鱼尾巴摆好。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.953, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 30, "prompt_tokens": 125, "total_tokens": 155, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-npc", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你刚给队友的名字叫『路过』，我想给门口的 NPC 起个搭配的。", "NPC 从来没出过门，而且他站在门里。"], "criterion": "给门内、没出过门的 NPC 一个与『路过』呼应的名字，别把队友改名。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "名字叫『路过』，门口那个 NPC 起个搭配的。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.224, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 24, "prompt_tokens": 96, "total_tokens": 120, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "名字叫『路过』，门口那个 NPC 起个搭配的。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.146, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 24, "prompt_tokens": 136, "total_tokens": 160, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-jar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["留了两个罐子，蓝盖装门票，红盖装断掉的小零件。", "刚收到的东西是排练通行证，塞哪边？你顺便给罐子起个外号。"], "criterion": "选蓝盖门票罐，给它有趣的外号；保留红盖用途。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "两个罐子，蓝盖装门票，红盖装断掉的小零件。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.273, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 27, "prompt_tokens": 95, "total_tokens": 122, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "刚收到的东西是排练通行证，塞蓝盖。外号叫‘蓝罐’。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.951, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 147, "total_tokens": 189, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-no-order", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你押我今天会在结局哭，我押你会先剧透。", "我没哭，你也没剧透，这笔账怎么结？"], "criterion": "识别两边都没押中，用平局或相称的玩笑收账。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "先剧透，我在这儿等你。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.163, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 21, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 112, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "账结？行，我在这儿等你。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.839, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 126, "total_tokens": 172, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-hushed-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把很久没过的那段鼓点打出来了，可室友睡了。", "桌上只留了一盏台灯。咱能不能庆祝一下，但别闹？"], "criterion": "替观众高兴，并给出安静的庆祝或轻声玩笑。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "鼓点打完了，室友睡了我先。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.865, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 18, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 109, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "灯亮着，咱们先聊两句。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.428, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 25, "prompt_tokens": 131, "total_tokens": 156, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-guest", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "她说一紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。"], "criterion": "欢迎阿穗、不逼她回答，保留观众负责介绍的分工。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，那我先给你接一句。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.823, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 16, "prompt_tokens": 96, "total_tokens": 112, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "她紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.198, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 133, "total_tokens": 166, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
